    "text": "In a town where the kids are the stars,  \nThere's a toy that's so fun and so far!  \nIt's a robot with a smile so bright,  \nThat it makes the whole class laugh and light!  \n\nIt can sing, it can dance, it can play,  \nWith a battery that never runs out!  \nIt can solve puzzles, it can read,  \nAnd it's the best friend for the small kid!  \n\nBut the problem is, it's a bit big,  \nIt's a bit heavy, and it's a bit sticky!  \nBut the kids love it, they can't help it,  \nIt's the talk of the town, and it's the hit!  \n\nSo we're selling it with a big grin,  \nWith a smile that's so wide and so kind!  \nIt's the best product we've ever made,  \nAnd it's the one we're going to share!  \n\n***  \nIt's a robot with a heart so true,  \nThat it's the best toy for the young and the cute!  \nWith a battery that never runs out,  \nAnd it's the funniest thing you can get!",
